# Pinned noVNC web client for the Docker simulator's local screen view
# (localhost:6080). The kiosk image ships none: Remote Control runs through the
# console's relay, whose noVNC is cloudflare-control's pinned @novnc/novnc.
#
# Debian's `novnc` package depends on Node.js and a stack of OpenStack Python
# libraries (~130 MB installed) that the browser client never uses: noVNC is
# static HTML and JavaScript served by websockify. So the release is fetched
# directly and verified against this checksum; install-novnc.sh refuses to
# install anything that does not match.
#
# To move to a new release:
#
#   VERSION=1.7.0
#   curl -fsSLo novnc.tar.gz "https://github.com/novnc/noVNC/archive/refs/tags/v${VERSION}.tar.gz"
#   sha256sum novnc.tar.gz
#
# The simulator's README opens /vnc.html, so check it still loads after a bump.

VERSION=1.7.0
SHA256=b1003a11b6e6e8d8f7f5e5586daae7f8ca651d8aee0aa155ff9ac841c48f52c6
